{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["马车的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见有四辆车从两山中间出来；那山是铜山。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第一辆车套着红马，第二辆车套着黑马。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第三辆车套着白马，第四辆车套着有斑点的壮马。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我就问与我说话的天使说：「主啊，这是什么意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使回答我说：「这是天的四风，是从普天下的主面前出来的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["套着黑马的车往北方去，白马跟随在后；有斑点的马往南方去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["壮马出来，要在遍地走来走去。天使说：「你们只管在遍地走来走去。」它们就照样行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又呼叫我说：「看哪，往北方去的已在北方安慰我的心。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["为约书亚加冕"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「你要从被掳之人中取黑玳、多比雅、耶大雅的金银。这三人是从巴比伦来到西番雅的儿子约西亚的家里。当日你要进他的家，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["取这金银做冠冕，戴在约撒答的儿子大祭司约书亚的头上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["对他说，万军之耶和华如此说：看哪，那名称为大卫苗裔的，他要在本处长起来，并要建造耶和华的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他要建造耶和华的殿，并担负尊荣，坐在位上掌王权；又必在位上作祭司，使两职之间筹定和平。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["这冠冕要归希连",{"noteId":6},"、多比雅、耶大雅，和西番雅的儿子贤",{"noteId":7},"，放在耶和华的殿里为记念。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["远方的人也要来建造耶和华的殿，你们就知道万军之耶和华差遣我到你们这里来。你们若留意听从耶和华—你们 神的话，这事必然成就。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"就是黑玳","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"就是约西亚","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}